<ol>
<li>Cowdrey, H.E.J. (1998). Pope Gregory VII, 1073–1085. Oxford University Press.</<li>
<li>Uta-Renate Blumenthal (1988). The Investiture Controversy. University of Pennsylvania Press.</<li>
<li>Catholic Encyclopedia (1913). "Pope St. Gregory VII".</<li>
